<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi's Ahsa Development Co 1996 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Saudi's Ahsa Development Co 1996 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		12.9    vs   15.9</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	  13.2    vs   16.3</p>
<p> Income		    16.3    vs   19.2</p>
<p> Expenses		   3.0    vs    2.9</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds  348.3    vs  335.4</p>
<p>Full Name: Al-Ahsa Development Company.</p>
<p>Note - Saudi Arabia's industrial giant Saudi Basic Industries Corp holds a 10 percent stake in the company and the rest is owned by Saudi and other Gulf Arab investors.</p>
</text>
